<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains 1.167 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains 1.167 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned two auctions whereby it sought to drain 1.167 billion pesos from the secondary market on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    900 million    2 days   23.74 pct</p>
<p>    267 million    1 day    23.50 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
